    <skos:historyNote>Source: ALA</skos:historyNote>
    <skos:note>Example Implementations Source Code: https://github.com/FilteredPush/sci_name_qc/blob/v1.1.2/src/main/java/org/filteredpush/qc/sciname/DwCSciNameDQ.java#L212</skos:note>
    <skos:note>Example Implementations: Kurator/FilteredPush sci_name_qc Library (Morris &amp; Dou 2025)</skos:note>
    <skos:note>TG2 Validation NAME CODED Test VOCABULARY Conformance Parameterized CORE</skos:note>
